 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "The air can't keep up with the ground.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 3.35,
   "sha256": "66fbc90519a5b93317ed3f7a120af57e8e78ace30780a2aecbbdf7c08aa47c57"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "s23",
   "text": "It is pulled along only by friction, so for the first hours it is left behind.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 3.39,
   "sha256": "28400160ce95793d134be04b20efb05084e10cb36488145434a9bac7bd734bba"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "u_ground",
   "text": "The ground moves through it at about a thousand and forty miles an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 3.61,
   "sha256": "38b4fddef669ce1462b9367c10ce86dc14d45eec64e9991da990307ed7068364"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "u_gust",
   "text": "The strongest gust ever measured was about two hundred and fifty miles an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 4.233,
   "sha256": "49189acc29b92ece44f04ca2d8d2c4e74810e59145a6b593673c56f57d5d2184"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "s26",
   "text": "This wind would be four times faster, blowing from the east, because the ground is running ahead of the air.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 6.54,
   "sha256": "6da2cf2fbf64be97819a4e31e364239feb43fdfccf2e2092940fb16dc2eceba5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "s27",
   "text": "Winds like that would strip the surface, and they'd only be the beginning.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 3.05,
   "sha256": "8122ca012b9d895d25d63d2624b3e8419609537e87a08d153dfe67cdce17773a"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
